    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>. Then the number of points in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is not differentiable is _____ .",
