  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr></mtr><mtr></mtr><mtr></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now plotting the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/64bf9c97-51c3-4b6e-98e0-32d420433319-image.png\" style=\"width: 390px; height: 249px;\" /></p><p>We can see&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not differentiable&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(where<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>)</p></blockquote>",
